{"id":"wb-6-639","name":"关林","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"关林","text":"关林，又称关林庙、关林景区，位于中华人民共和国河南省洛阳市洛龙区关林街道，相传为埋葬东汉末年刘备阵营将领关羽首级之地，始建于东汉末年，重修于明万历二十年（1592年），是一座“冢、庙、林”三祀合一的明清古建筑群。关林是AAAA级旅游景区、全国重点文物保护单位，国家级非物质文化遗产“关公信俗”保护单位，“关圣文化史迹”、“万里茶道”世界文化遗产申遗单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%B3%E6%9E%97","revisionId":94656951,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94656951","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1525f216f54b77a267489d20.jpg","title":"Guanlin.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Guanlin.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c3/Guanlin.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"张骐","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"河南洛阳关林","width":320,"height":213}}